Title = {Effects of the Grazing Exclusion Policy on Pheasant Nesting Success and
   Predation Risk in the Protected Areas of Southwestern
   China(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(s
   ic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic
